<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第三幕 · 它是不是变量</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>同一批模型换 harness，会分层——这条只能当信号</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 40}}><Box style={{width: 430, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 120, fontWeight: 700, color: "#8A5A00", lineHeight: 1.0, letterSpacing: -2}}>76%</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", marginTop: 12}}>光看 issue 文本就能报出 bug 文件；换成没见过的仓库只剩 53%</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 26}}>连榜单分数本身，都可能掺着记忆</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 10}}>ICSE 2026《The SWE-Bench Illusion》：相当一部分榜单增益是记住了训练数据，不是推理。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 682, flexDirection: "column", gap: 16, justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 22, background: "rgba(138,90,0,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#8A5A00"}}>✕ 趋势级</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8}}>那份 8-harness 对照是一条快讯，而且只有标题级捕获——没有方法论、不可复现。</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 20, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#0F6E56"}}>可当基准</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 8}}>可复现、有方法论、有第三方审计</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 20, background: "rgba(138,90,0,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#8A5A00"}}>只能当信号</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8}}>快讯、标题级、无方法论——本 talk 不引用它任何数字</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.6}}>诚实交代：本幕三条证据没有一条够格当基准——我的结论靠它们指向同一个方向。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>26 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
